{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人車婉婉、何依婷、歐瑞偉、李偉健、徐榮、趙浚承及監製羅永賢等中午（27日）現身將軍澳街頭，為處境劇《愛·回家之三代同糖》進行快閃宣傳，眾人悉心打扮跟現場街坊互動，吸引大批粉絲到場支持。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;車婉婉以經</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T09:42:29.474973+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T09:36:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T09:38:15.487988+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T09:38:15.487988+00:00","content_hash":"6c0f36a8c4de9f0d3099f1c89621f7b20474375c4e1e9b98a33dd4510419b575","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}